{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trizon is a rogue-like deckbuilding game. Players take on the role of an escapee relentlessly pushing forward to  find a way out. The game combines auto-battler mechanics, where creatures attack on their own, with instant-effect spell cards. Battles are fast-paced and dynamic, set against a simple and restrained art style, making both in-battle and out-of-battle decisions equally significant and thought-provoking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players can...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use creatures and spells to control the battlefield, defeating all enemy creatures to secure victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fuse any two cards in your deck to create completely overpowered single-card combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Merge countless creatures to cultivate your own unique, ultimate fusion monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plan your route and take risks to achieve greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anticipate the flow of battle, triggering a series of fully automated chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft infinite loops, defeating any opponent in a single turn with limitless combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter adorable card illustrations, making your adventure feel less lonely.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3064290?t=1747292273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3064290?t=1747292273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064290/52518044675993614819dd85d608f8dfe970d561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747292273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064290/52518044675993614819dd85d608f8dfe970d561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=174729227